OL,3,AUnion calls for halt to graded Ofsted
OL,4,Ainspections over health concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland's biggest school leaders' union
OL,7,Fhas called for a halt to graded Ofsted
OL,8,Finspections, saying they could pose a
OL,9,F"risk to life" for school staff.
OL,11,FThe National Association of Head
OL,12,FTeachers (NAHT) said the change to
OL,13,Finspections, rolled out nationally just
OL,14,Funder a year ago, had been severely
OL,15,Fharmful to school leaders' welfare.
OL,17,FIt said schools should instead be rated
OL,18,Fusing short narrative reports that set
OL,19,Fout their strengths and areas they
OL,20,Fcould improve.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
